# Cloudflare Pages deploys this entire repo root as static output (Build
# output directory "/" — there's no build step, the site is hand-rolled
# static HTML/CSS/JS with no bundler). Everything below is internal
# tooling that lives in this same repo for convenience but was never meant
# to be publicly served: the monitor/ admin dashboard + source-monitoring
# pipeline (its real database and .env.local are gitignored and never
# committed, so no secrets leak — but its frontend source and admin API
# surface shouldn't be public either), the api/ payment functions (written
# in Vercel's function format, not Cloudflare Pages Functions — deployed
# as static output they'd just serve as readable source text, not run),
# dev tooling, and internal docs/notes.
/monitor/*  /404.html  404
/api/*      /404.html  404
/docs/*     /404.html  404
/test/*     /404.html  404
/.claude/*  /404.html  404
/.git/*     /404.html  404
/README.txt       /404.html  404
/dev-server.js    /404.html  404
/.env.example     /404.html  404
